reference-semantics/semantics/float.k:47:  // uninterpreted Bool a proof case-splits on — a SINGLE compare per branch, not a nonlinear cascade),
reference-semantics/semantics/float.k:48:  // [concrete] for krun. Additive, sort-disjoint from the Int rules. (has_close_elements: the pairwise
